<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on Henderson Land.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Henderson Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch, said on Tuesday it launched 40 million American-style call warrants on shares of Henderson Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$60.30     PREMIUM	     10.65 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.3838    GEARING	     4.84x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  25.MAR.98    PAYDATE	     14.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    LISTING DATE	16.APR.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$67.00     MIN EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p>	 -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
